# Smolderweb Carrier from En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (Lower Blackrock Spire).
# Sources: quests.json (Kibler's quest, 15 eggs, level 55); the world database
# (the reward, item 12529; each Spire Spider Egg object gives 1-3 eggs); the
# knowledge base's quest notes (egg room, spiderlings, the party-size rule);
# Lower Blackrock Spire (55-60) is in Forever.

step Kibler at Flame Crest
  tip Kibler stands inside the cave at Flame Crest, the camp in northern Burning Steppes east of Blackrock Mountain. He also gives Kibler's Exotic Pets (the Worg Carrier): take both, they are done in the same run.
  accept 4862

step Lower Blackrock Spire
  tip Lower Blackrock Spire is a group of five, level 55-60, inside Blackrock Mountain. The Spire Spider Eggs lie around Mother Smolderweb's nest in the Skitterweb Tunnels, the spider halls: click them until you have 15 (each gives one to three). Hard-hitting spiderlings can hatch as you loot. By player reports the eggs cannot be looted in a raid group, so keep the party at five or fewer.
  collect 12530 x15 quest 4862 @33.2,24.9 -- Lower Blackrock Spire

step Back to Kibler
  turnin 4862
  collect 12529 @65.9,21.9            -- Smolderweb Carrier
